{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：部分感受意象堆得过密，个别联想如“年少时初恋的下午”过于具体，反而不如X直观自然。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮关键词让人迅速抓住每段叙事重点，话与感受交替排列，加上感受词按音乐节点出现，更适合边听边扫。它把人物从害怕给对方负担、逐渐感到被接纳，到渴望互相依靠、害怕失去，最后接受未来的不确定，连成了比较完整的心理变化过程。X更直白紧凑，但部分感受词像并列标签，且结尾“这回终于说完”“熟悉的声音远远回应”容易让人误以为人物最终已经完成告白并得到回应。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a2d6767d-6c8b-48e9-a988-58c57e91b23e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T053949515632Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:41:03.515353+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2da1d30c79b219b44bcf479ab40a604ebb94eabd6c9d9b1fa398ee33274fec64", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": 